<title>USA: Marlton Tech Q4 net up, shr off.</title>
<headline>Marlton Tech Q4 net up, shr off.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Year Ended  For The Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				  December 31,	 December 31,</p>
<p>			    1996	  1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> NET SALES	$38,315,600 $27,671,763 $9,206,583 $7,162,646</p>
<p>GAIN FROM CONTRACT</p>
<p>  AMENDMENT	 1,200,000	   ---    200,000	  ---</p>
<p>PROVISION (BENEFIT)</p>
<p>  FOR INCOME TAXES  350,000   (538,000)  (260,000)  (696,000)</p>
<p> NET INCOME	 2,340,153   1,252,814    882,398    878,630</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE NUMBER</p>
<p>OF COMMON SHARES</p>
<p>  OUTSTANDING     5,233,748   3,935,700  5,589,035  3,908,241</p>
<p>NET INCOME PER</p>
<p>  COMMON SHARE:	  0.45	  0.32	 0.16	 0.22</p>
<p>NOTE:  Marlton Technologies Inc said the gain of $1.2 million resulted from a transaction with its Japanese joint venture partner.</p>
